   "stem": {
      "text": "The third-degree Taylor polynomial for \\( f \\) about \\( x = 0 \\) is \\( 3 + x - 2x^{2} + 5x^{3} \\). Let \\( g(x) = \\sin(2x) f(x) \\). Find the third-degree Taylor polynomial for \\( g \\) about \\( x = 0 \\)."
