         "text": "Start from \\( \\sin u = u - \\frac{u^{3}}{3!} + \\frac{u^{5}}{5!} - \\cdots \\). Replace \\( u \\) by \\( 2x \\), raising the whole of \\( 2x \\) to each power. Through degree 3, \\( \\sin(2x) \\approx 2x - \\frac{4}{3}x^{3} \\).",
