               ]
            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "Multiply by \\( 3 + x - 2x^{2} + 5x^{3} \\): the product is \\( 6x + 2x^{2} - 8x^{3} + \\frac{26}{3}x^{4} + \\frac{8}{3}x^{5} - \\frac{20}{3}x^{6} \\).",
